      "title": "Multiple Award Construction Contract for Inspection, Repair, and Renovation Construction Services for Petroleum, Oil, and Lubricant Fuel Systems at Various Locations Worldwide",
      "description_text": "PCI BHATE JV LLC - Selected as one of ten prime awardees on the Global Petroleum, Oils, and Lubricants (GPOL) Indefinite Delivery Indefinite Quantity (IDIQ) Multiple Award Construction Contract (MACC). Administered by the Naval Facilities Engineering and Expeditionary Warfare Center (NAVFAC EXWC) in Port Hueneme, California, under the NAVFAC GPOL program, this vehicle carries a maximum cumulative value of $997,000,000 over a 60-month ordering period. The primary purpose of the GPOL MACC is to deliver global engineering and construction services, specifically performing inspection, testing, design, and construction (primarily maintenance and repair) for critical pipelines, fuel storage tanks, and associated POL-related equipment at various locations worldwide.",
